  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "The cook-off is on in the Claude Monet kitchen, and Chef Barinov has decided Max needs help, but he can't be seen giving it. So he rings the kitchen phone and pretends to be Max's mother, with the recipe. Max catches on and plays along in front of the other cooks. Listen in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
